{"id":"prikaz","lemma":"приказ","pos":"noun","rank":723,"glosses":["order (oral), command, orders (written)","board, department, office, chancellery"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8f/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B7.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%B7.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"приказа","plural":"приказы"},"examples":[{"text":"Ты отдал приказ?","en":"Did you give the order?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give back","l":"отдать"},null]},{"text":"Вы понимаете свои приказы?","en":"Do you understand your orders?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to understand","l":"понимать"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Это приказ?","en":"Is that an order?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Просто отдай приказ.","en":"Just give the order.","words":[{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to give back","l":"отдать"},null]},{"text":"У всех нас есть свои приказы.","en":"We all have our orders.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"all","l":"весь"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]}]}